  "description": {
   "en": "A real live-bullet romance that stains the Japanese archipelago with the blood of revenge!! Kirihara Masato, a boy known as \"Young\", has three fathers. Urushizawa Choichiro, Susa Shozen, and Yokatani Chuji -- the three of them disguise themselves as wedding and funeral directors, and protect Masato, the surviving son of Kirihara Goichi, a gangster killed in a gang war, from the clutches of an organization. Masato has a faint affection for his female teacher, Ogata Yumiko. The shadow of an organization that aims to eradicate the Kirihara Group is drawing ever closer!!"
  },
